        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "Table 5 shows complications at final follow-up. There was a deep infection (surgical site infection) in the local bone graft group. There was no other complication in the local bone graft group. However, sensory disturbance around the iliac crest in eight patients and donor site pain in six patients were found in the ICBG group.",
